    { "key": "era_folk.sentry", "value": "Lost Castle Sentry" },
    { "key": "era_folk.sentry.0", "value": "I was guarding the castle gate, and when I opened my eyes I was in this forest. Where has my castle gone?" },
    { "key": "era_folk.sentry.1", "value": "There are iron drums rolling about in the rocky fields. They reek of oil, and they're not from our castle stores." },
    { "key": "era_folk.sentry.2", "value": "At night I saw blue lights floating and turning above the woods. You can't fool a sentry's eyes." },
    { "key": "era_folk.sentry.3", "value": "One fruit from that tree keeps me going a whole day. Kind folk in this village." },
    { "key": "era_folk.pilgrim", "value": "Red-Hooded Pilgrim Knight" },
    { "key": "era_folk.pilgrim.0", "value": "I'm on pilgrimage to the old pillar ruins. An iron eye floating over the pillars — an ill omen." },
    { "key": "era_folk.pilgrim.1", "value": "I learned why the mossy altar's lanterns never go out — an iron box hovering over it pours out light." },
    { "key": "era_folk.pilgrim.2", "value": "My sword stays sheathed. The beasts of this forest are timid; they harm no one." },
    { "key": "era_folk.pilgrim.3", "value": "People from other times keep crossing over. There must be a rift torn in the sky." },
    { "key": "era_folk.courier", "value": "Courier Dal-eum" },
    { "key": "era_folk.courier.0", "value": "The address just says 'forest village mailbox.' There are no street addresses out here." },
    { "key": "era_folk.courier.1", "value": "I wanted to park by the delivery counter, but there are no roads, so I walk everywhere." },
    { "key": "era_folk.courier.2", "value": "Did you see a covered car in the flower field? Looks like a coworker's, but nobody was around." },
    { "key": "era_folk.courier.3", "value": "First village where I get stamps instead of signatures. Wait — were those paw prints…?" },
    { "key": "era_folk.photographer", "value": "Photographer Chalna" },
    { "key": "era_folk.photographer.0", "value": "There's a machine floating right in the middle of the fairy ring! That's a magazine cover." },
    { "key": "era_folk.photographer.1", "value": "The mist ghosts don't show up in photos. Just a blue glow smudged in the corner." },
    { "key": "era_folk.photographer.2", "value": "My phone battery is dying. I suppose this village has no outlets?" },
    { "key": "era_folk.photographer.3", "value": "A forest goblin ran off with my lens cap. Think I can get it back?" },
    { "key": "era_folk.chrononaut", "value": "Golden Exosuit Time Traveler" },
    { "key": "era_folk.chrononaut.0", "value": "This exosuit is built for walking only. I can't keep up with the running beasts." },
    { "key": "era_folk.chrononaut.1", "value": "In the archives this forest is listed as 'the lost forest.' So this is what it was like alive." },
    { "key": "era_folk.chrononaut.2", "value": "The debris floating around the forest is from my time. It got swept here through the rift." },
    { "key": "era_folk.chrononaut.3", "value": "Wishes on the wish stone come true? In my era, stones like that are only in museums." },
    { "key": "era_folk.surveyor", "value": "Crash-Landed Surveyor Rumi" },
    { "key": "era_folk.surveyor.0", "value": "My lander got caught in the time rift and broke apart. Its parts must be floating all over the forest." },
    { "key": "era_folk.surveyor.1", "value": "My searchlight is hovering by the standing stone in the rocky fields. It still lights up." },
    { "key": "era_folk.surveyor.2", "value": "The air in this era is sweet. I think I can switch off my filter and breathe." },
    { "key": "era_folk.surveyor.3", "value": "I sent a rescue signal. Estimated arrival… three hundred years from now." },
